## Ⅳ. STACK INTEGRATION

```
CPL-L ← FOUNDATION
  │
  ├── Governs what CPL-C contracts may contain
  ├── Governs what CPL-P pipelines may do
  └── Cannot be modified except via its own amendment procedures

CPL-C ← STRUCTURE
  │
  ├── Implements CPL-L laws as executable contracts
  ├── Provides the framework for CPL-P pipelines to operate within
  └── Bridges law to execution

CPL-P ← EXECUTION
  │
  ├── Operates within CPL-C contracts
  ├── Subject to CPL-L laws
  └── The actual thought process — how the mind thinks
```

